#: e07b8f5c01b7408ca34d45c3784a05ac
msgid ""
"Each channel takes effect immediately. Joint limits and open/close "
"positions come from `/robot_description` (closer URDF limit to the "
"initial position = closed). Example names: controller "
"`left_gripper_controller`, joint `left_gripper_joint`."
