msgid ""
"Feedback has not already fired for this command (a new command resets the"
" flag)"
msgstr "本条命令尚未触发过力反馈（新命令会重置该标志）"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/6-gripper_teleop_plugins.md:39
#: c7ae4ac7adb04095be883f7be6d63e28
msgid ""
"Trigger: `|current_effort| > force_threshold`. New target = current + "
"(original − current) × `force_feedback_ratio`. `0.0` stops here; `1.0` "
"continues to the original target; default `0.5`."
msgstr ""
"触发：`|current_effort| > force_threshold`。新目标 = 当前位置 +（原始目标 − 当前位置）× "
"`force_feedback_ratio`。`0.0` 停在此处；`1.0` 继续到原始目标；默认 `0.5`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/6-gripper_teleop_plugins.md:41
#: 47f5e3597b314ed29e23d8456e31f93f
msgid ""
"YAML keys in the README: `joint`, `use_effort_interface` (default "
"`true`), `force_threshold` (default `0.1`), `force_feedback_ratio` "
"(default `0.5`). Startup vs runtime: [Controller ROS 2 "
"parameters](8-ros2_parameters.md)."
msgstr ""
"README 中的 YAML 键：`joint`、`use_effort_interface`（默认 "
"`true`）、`force_threshold`（默认 `0.1`）、`force_feedback_ratio`（默认 `0.5`）。启动时 "
"vs 运行时：[控制器 ROS 2 参数](8-ros2_parameters.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/6-gripper_teleop_plugins.md:43
#: 48bd040e7b274b16b8e7b4ff078f42d8
msgid ""
"Python: `left_gripper_handler.send_joint_positions` (direct stroke, "
"**no** feedback), `send_target_command` (0/1), `send_position_percent` "
"(0–1). Same `target_command` / `target_percent` names on a 灵巧手 go to "
"[Basic Joint Controller](7-basic_joint_controller.md) Home-config blend, "
"not this force path. Map: "
"[ros2_robot_interface](../python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md)."
msgstr ""
"Python：`left_gripper_handler.send_joint_positions`（直接行程，**无力反馈**）、`send_target_command`（0/1）、`send_position_percent`（0–1）。灵巧手上同名的"
" `target_command` / `target_percent` 走 [Basic Joint "
"Controller](7-basic_joint_controller.md) 的 Home "
"构型混合，而不是这条力反馈路径。对照表：[ros2_robot_interface](../python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md)。"

